# Browser safety

For every interactive or authenticated browser task:

1. Read [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md).
2. Load [`.agents/skills/browser-session/SKILL.md`](../../.agents/skills/browser-session/SKILL.md).
3. Use only `npm run browser -- ...` with the explicitly configured dedicated profile.
4. Never open or attach to an integrated, system-default, or personal-profile browser unless the user explicitly requests that exception for the current task.
5. Pause for user takeover on login, 2FA, CAPTCHA, or password prompts.
6. End without closing the browser, tabs, or profile.

